{"version":1,"content":"<p>【10:45更新】昨晚（25日）9時許，一名男子昏迷倒臥於旺角新填地街387號對開路邊，懷疑從高處墮下，接報到場救護員即場為其急救，再由救護車送往廣華醫院，惟搶救後證實不治。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:37.015481+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T02:45:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T15:18:16.054350+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:19.347140+00:00","content_hash":"9c1d5cd97b59f2ad8bb6a1fd215c397910d5d22f8f63047a6bbec2e64e7a9d27","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}